    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> be the unit vectors along the three positive coordinate axes. Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math></p><p>be three vectors such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then, which of the following is/are TRUE?</p>",
